cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this experimental code, please cite the associated paper."
title: "Gradient-Guided Learning for LesserDNN with Quantized Weights: CIFAR-10 Experiments"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Reproducible CIFAR-10 experiments evaluating three gradient-guided update
  modes for LesserDNN with quantized forward weights and float32 shadow
  weights, together with a full-precision PyTorch reference and an 80-run,
  8/9/10/11-level strict-search versus Gradient time-budget comparison.
